Difference:           Encapsulation vs Abstraction
Concept  	                     Meaning
Encapsulation	      Data hide        control access
Abstraction	          Hide complexity  show essential features

what will be the use case of the Abstraction
since you'r building 
api calls ---> hide fetch logic
services  ---> hide busness logic 
components---> hide ui complexity
librarries---> hides implimentation


Feature	    Encapsulation 🔒	 Abstraction 🎯
Purpose	    Protect data	     Hide complexity
Focus	    Variables	         Methods / behavior
Example	    #balance	         withdraw()
User sees	Controlled acces     Simple interface


Encapsulation  is used to achive Abstraction

first ---> hides data (Encapsulation)
then  ---> expose only usefull method(Abstraction)

if interviewer asked 

"Encapsulation" is about restricting direct access to data and protecting it using private fields and controlled methods, while "abstraction" is about hiding complex implementation details and exposing only the necessary functionality to the user.

